  "releaseNotes": "No exceptions inside the package either: every method checks its arguments and answers with ResultStatus.Invalid and a message saying what is missing, network errors and timeouts become ResultStatus.Unavailable, and failures keep their message and status on the way out. Every member is documented, with every parameter.",
